From: Andrew Stellman <andrew@stellman.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 01:17:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] v1.6.1 [council-1]: gate verdict and witness fixes
 (A1-A7, B gaps 1-4, C2, C5)

Witness ignores the WARN count in Total: (AGENTS.md written after the
gate is one WARN) and still compares RESULT: and the FAIL/DECISION/CLEANUP
counts exactly; protocol and agent files say to run it before AGENTS.md.
Gate: overreach narration names unlinked bugs instead of none; manifest
records filtered against BUGS.md even with zero bugs; missing regression
patch named as such; decisions pass headed 'What needs your decision:';
verdict_state 'decisions'; multi-repo FAIL lines carry [repo]; generic
fallback names checks by leading words.
